A small update, making things clearer for new players:
- added player number indicators to the controls tutorial;
- added custom mouse cursor;
- added hint about one passenger per vehicle limit to the passenger tutorial;
- added a new audio track;
- updated credits;
- changed default keybindings for both players;
- fixed leaving the key bindings options menu;
- fixed players names in multiplayer panel after profile change.

