This was a long road, but we've finally got our UI finished :)
- added 20th achievement with a special passenger;
- added new audio track;
- updated the UI graphics;
- updated all weapons and equipment descriptions;
- potential fix to audio stuttering;
- fixed granting of the "Sooo Close!" achievement;
- fixed tutorial level metal walls rendering over brick walls;
- fixed level 48 top-right fan's area of effect;
- fixed creating a new profile outside login menu.

